{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carve Your Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lost soul wandering through the ruins of a long forgotten society. You and up to seven other friends are tasked with protecting Jane, a young woman trapped in a perpetual cycle of death and rebirth.  Use powerful spells and weapons to fight your way through the stronghold to uncover ancient knowledge and meet a powerful\u00a0deity held deep within its chambers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661160/extras/78dc22b02b0635f2aff38f6308680535.avif?t=1767543689\" width=1575 height=185 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8 Player Co-Op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a team of 8 souls controlling one vessel and face unknowable dangers in this cooperative turn-based dungeon crawler. Each person builds their own unique play-style through spell cards and a unique class card chosen before each run, maybe you have a party member that specializes entirely on damage, maybe they could use a little bit of healing every now and then! You may even a whole team of casters that needs a quick boost to their spells, or you could all focus on making one party member a powerhouse capable of annihilating anything that stands in their way!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661160/extras/fa93d106a1c0d2955e5e7e7589510e2a.avif?t=1767543689\" width=1575 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Importance of Coordination </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master many different skills tailored to help a team. Coordination and cooperation is crucial for success.\u00a0Collect unique skill and spell cards that will aid you and your team in combat.\u00a0 Each card provides a unique benefit, granting useful buffs to one of your friends, weakening an enemy, mending your teammates wounds and damaging monsters that block your path.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661160/extras/13ab1116e06ccccd3e159b4117494b5a.avif?t=1767543689\" width=1575 height=185 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Guilt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661160/7c980d2a2cc22532ca4428e53169a0d7dee7a13c.jpg"},{"name":"Detachment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661160/f98f827dfc3f8d3346bba2cbcea82254b3ec7de2.jpg"},{"name":"Moving On","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661160/40300eb5c6409b681184c13ecef841aee09b307b.jpg"},{"name":"No Rest for the Wicked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661160/c785fd7c49b41ceeae596bbb322b449697d696b0.jpg"},{"name":"Down in the Dirt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661160/2867f125cd5a9e43fe05b26f319bf977622d4574.jpg"},{"name":"Poster Child","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661160/3095656165fbc9cf69ea322288509326d27059f8.jpg"},{"name":"A Cut Above","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661160/cc583f6fbdd407796fb27cbb07c87dda8d605dd0.jpg"},{"name":"But I Want More!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661160/df07f18251bcc0dbc002fd7025223d83d3fb6ff5.jpg"},{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661160/f41a0dae619983c08cb5be32a4131863bc96c7b8.jpg"},{"name":"In Deep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661160/c7b309033b7c82f9d891a18763022cd51f89d8ce.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://sto